    {title:'▶ TECH & SOFTWARE',bg:'#1565C0',rows:['Shopify MK — Fee','Shopify MK — Txn','Shopify MT — Fee','Shopify MT — Txn','Claude Pro','Google Workspace','Canva','TOTAL TECH & SOFTWARE']},
    {title:'▶ ADMINISTRACIÓN',bg:'#37474F',rows:['BP Consulting','Remuneraciones','Otros Admin','TOTAL ADMINISTRACIÓN']},
  ];
  sections.forEach(sec=>{
    html+=`<tr class="shdr"><td colspan="${labels.length+2}" style="background:${sec.bg}">${sec.title}</td></tr>`;
    sec.rows.forEach(rn=>{
      const row=fr(rn);if(!row)return;
